  "description": "A comprehensive, high-performance statistics library for .NET providing essential mathematical statistics \n      functions for real-valued numerical data. FTI.Statistics offers robust statistical analysis capabilities \n      with production-ready reliability, comprehensive input validation, and enhanced developer experience \n      through detailed XML documentation and IntelliSense tooltips.\n\n      Key Features:\n      • Central Tendency: Mean, Median, Mode, Geometric/Harmonic means with weights support\n      • Dispersion: Variance, Standard Deviation, Range, Interquartile Range (IQR)\n      • Distribution: Quantiles, Percentiles, Summary statistics with comprehensive overview\n      • Relationships: Correlation (Pearson/Spearman), Covariance, Linear Regression (OLS)\n      • Advanced: Kernel Density Estimation, Normal Distribution, Beta/Gamma/Special functions\n      • Developer Experience: Rich XML documentation, detailed tooltips, comprehensive error handling\n\n      Perfect for business analytics, data science, research, quality control, and educational applications.\n      Zero external dependencies for lightweight deployment.",
